flutter_screenutil_wasm

Derived from flutter_screenutil 5.9.3:
https://pub.dev/packages/flutter_screenutil/versions/5.9.3
https://github.com/OpenFlutter/flutter_screenutil

Original source headers credit 李卓原. Original attribution notices are
retained in the source. The original Apache License, Version 2.0 is included
in LICENSE.

This independent fork renames the Dart package/public library and replaces
recursive resize traversal with an explicit stack. It also adds documentation,
an example, regression tests, and a local diagnostic acknowledgement for the
legacy textScaleFactor getter without changing that getter's behavior.

Fork repository: https://github.com/2697a/flutter_screenutil_wasm
This fork is not an official release of the upstream project.
